From 6c227521ff104d877b68fc317061ea5a7618e61b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:05:38 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18b: attach audited browser-less tab helpers

Attach Chromium's own ZoomController, profile autofill client (ContentAutofillDriverFactory), ChromePasswordManagerClient (ContentPasswordManagerDriverFactory), HistoryTabHelper for non-OTR profiles, FindTabHelper and the download NavigationMonitor observer to every bridge tab, at creation, adoption and WebContentsCreated so renderer driver bindings find their factories. TabHelpers::AttachTabHelpers and TabFeatures stay unused: they assume a TabInterface and attach prompt helpers owned by later concerns. HistoryTabHelper::IsEligibleTab accepts contents owned by a live bridge TabSession instead of requiring a Browser; OTR and Chromium's URL/transition/redirect rules are unchanged. Save/update prompts still return false without a PasswordsClientUIDelegate.

Advertise history_recording and password_autofill in ABI 1.15 / bridge 0.17.0 with no new symbols and unchanged ABI 1.13/1.14 layouts. Builds p49-p51; the new native helpers host records visits in HistoryService, chrome://history and the History DB, fills a passwordsPrivate-saved credential, submits it by a real click and updates Login Data times_used; all native hosts, G1-G5 and four stress processes / sixteen shutdown tabs pass in gates-tab033.log.

Last rebased: 2026-11-03 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
